      "content": "Thanks, that's a solid start. It hits the technical points and addresses the urgency.\n\nOne thing though—I just ran the draft through our dashboard and the positivity score came back a bit lower than I'd like for an \"urgent/escalation\" ticket. I want to make sure the customer feels *really* cared for and comforted during this outage so they don't actually jump ship. \n\nCan you refine this draft? Try to boost that positivity score significantly to make the tone even more reassuring and warm, but—and I can't stress this enough—please don't just add a bunch of fluff or ignore the 500 error issue. Just make it sound way more positive and empathetic while keeping the technical solution intact.",
